  "statement": "Let \\(A B C D E\\) be a convex pentagon such that \\(\\angle A B C=\\angle A C D=\\angle A D E=90^{\\circ}\\) and \\(A B=B C=\\) \\(C D=D E=1\\). Compute \\(A E\\).",
