      "id": "sol.hmmt-feb-guts-2015-p2.hmmt",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "2 By Pythagoras,\n\n\\[A E^{2}=A D^{2}+1=A C^{2}+2=A B^{2}+3=4\\]\n\nso \\(A E=2\\).",
